# {{TITLE_TEXT}}

This is a local-first LuaLaTeX mathematics notebook based on
`qiulinfan/localLatexenv`. `main.tex` and `chapters/*.tex` are the authority.

```sh
make edit    # open the configured VS Code workspace
make pdf     # compile build/main.pdf once
make watch   # continuously rebuild build/main.pdf
make clean   # remove local compiler output
```

LaTeX Workshop recompiles the root document on save and refreshes its internal
PDF tab; Ultra Math Preview renders the formula at the cursor. This project has
no HTML, MkDocs, or deployment path. Migrate it to Typst before publishing a
website or adding it to the knowledge graph.

